[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_rjvph")
name = "Blindness"
icon = ExtResource("1_biwb8")
short_info = "NULL OR GENERIC ALT-TEXT"
manual_text = "[b][u]CLINICAL OVERVIEW[/u][/b]
Blindness is a condition involving partial or complete loss of vision. It can range from low vision to total blindness, where a person cannot perceive light at all.

[b][u]FORMS & CAUSES[/u][/b]
[indent]
[b]•[/b] Forms include partial blindness, total blindness, congenital blindness, and legal blindness.
[b]•[/b] Legal blindness is typically defined as vision of 20/200 or worse even with correction.
[b]•[/b] It can result from many causes, such as cataracts, glaucoma, retinal diseases, or neurological damage.
[b]•[/b] Accessibility tools and assistive technologies can help people maintain independence and functionality.
[/indent]"
related_wcag = ExtResource("1_yt0pc")
